# Clinerules for Open Wearables/Trainer Agent

## Project-Specific Rules
- All wearable API integrations must use async/await patterns
- Heart rate data must be validated before storage
- GPS coordinates must be sanitized (remove precision beyond 4 decimal places)
- Workout sessions must have start/end timestamps
- Recovery metrics require 24-hour rolling windows

## Security
- Never log API keys or OAuth tokens
- All device credentials in `.env` (git-ignored)
- Audit all third-party wearable SDK dependencies quarterly

## Testing
- Unit tests required for all data transformation functions
- Integration tests for each wearable API endpoint
- Mock external APIs in test environment
